## Interface: 120000, 120001, 120005, 120007, 120100
## AllowLoadGameType: mainline
## Title: |cffff7d0aXerionUI|r - QoL Options
## Notes: Xerion-specific settings window (/xqol) and edit mode. Loaded on demand the first time the window is opened; nothing here runs at login.
## Author: Kiratank
## Dependencies: XerionUI-Plugin
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## X-Build: 2026-09-05.5

# No ## Version here on purpose: the window shows the plugin's version, read
# from XerionUI-Plugin.toc at runtime, so a release still bumps one line.
#
# Keep ## Interface identical to XerionUI-Plugin.toc. A LoadOnDemand addon whose
# Interface is behind refuses to load unless "Load out of date AddOns" is
# ticked, and the settings window then cannot open at all.
#
# Both files take the plugin's namespace from _G.XerionUIPlugin.__ns (a second
# addon gets its own table from `...`, not the plugin's).

# Edit mode first: the options file reads ns.hasEditMode when it builds.
XerionUI-Plugin_EditMode.lua
XerionUI-Plugin_Options.lua
